77	 * True when an unresolved specifier could name a file that was supplied to the
78	 * engine. Relative specifiers are excluded: yuku resolves those against the
79	 * supplied set directly (exact, then extensions, then '/index'), so a relative
80	 * miss proves the target was never supplied.
81	 */
